# Kaveh Furina Bennett Xianyun. ~20s Rot. Kaveh Vape plunge with inconsistent Pyro VV. Kaveh must avoid using skill until the end of the rotation to avoid ruining auras. Kaveh MUST delay before plunging to avoid his plunges overruning Hydro, see config. to 50% Collisions.

# Team
kaveh char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
kaveh add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
#kaveh add weapon="fruitfulhook" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
